{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Slipstream, play as a bubble and take part in exciting races against other players online or CPUs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/6a6430cb4afc6b72bd8919f5f29d33d3.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/0baa838c5f6047bb5b89573a08430728.poster.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/0baa838c5f6047bb5b89573a08430728.webm?t=1773394873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/0baa838c5f6047bb5b89573a08430728.mp4?t=1773394873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a bubble, move by shooting out small pieces of yourself, known as blips, to propel yourself in the opposite direction! This makes you smaller, allowing you to more easily fit through tight spaces, but be careful of getting too small and running out of bubble! Consume blips other racers leave behind to get bigger again! Smaller bubbles are easier to push around as well, so manage your size for the current situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/3474e6df808ba53c130a49ccf76d80cb.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/5a9d3ba785bbfe08ade67bc686349559.poster.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/5a9d3ba785bbfe08ade67bc686349559.webm?t=1773394873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/5a9d3ba785bbfe08ade67bc686349559.mp4?t=1773394873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubbles can charge their shot! Charging up slows you down and makes your shot stronger, which can be useful to change your direction, but uncharged shots can help you build speed. Mastering when to use each shot types is a key to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/6526ce2ebde75dad9144c025d8b556b8.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/853b2d6e97fb28ed365f3a1c6866cfad.avif?t=1773394873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras_big/853b2d6e97fb28ed365f3a1c6866cfad.webp?t=1773394873 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create online lobbies and invite up to 9 friends to race against! Simply vote on the track you want to play and it's off to the races! Push to go for first place, bump competitors to slow them down, the way you want to play is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/63432ce2accd95f528b91f2c47cfe208.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/a7670b9db9d5bdabf8ea09cfa9b2b4c3.avif?t=1773394873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras_big/a7670b9db9d5bdabf8ea09cfa9b2b4c3.webp?t=1773394873 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on a wide variety of different tracks based on different bodies of water! Each track has their own layout and unique mechanics. Try them out and find out which track resonates with you the most, or try and master all of them!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/384b7cd4bfd5f1ce6518f0e21c326519.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/38a407859c9536e19433700c6a59b497.avif?t=1773394873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras_big/38a407859c9536e19433700c6a59b497.avif?t=1773394873 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, you can play any track with no other racers and aim for the fastest time on Time Trials! This is a great mode to use to improve your skills. Compare your fastest time with other players! Reach certain time goals goals to earn medals, or see if you can get the world record time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/7e66df5b7c4a661210e42d72d4e16a5e.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slipstream is still in development! We hope you look forward to hearing what more we have in store!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602870?t=1773394873","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602870?t=1773394873","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/b4abb91c70445fa688ede51ac94a574755f7ab28/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773394873","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/b4abb91c70445fa688ede51ac94a574755f7ab28/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773394873","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4406130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Slipstream, play as a bubble and take part in exciting races against other players online or CPUs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/6a6430cb4afc6b72bd8919f5f29d33d3.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/0baa838c5f6047bb5b89573a08430728.poster.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/0baa838c5f6047bb5b89573a08430728.webm?t=1773394873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/0baa838c5f6047bb5b89573a08430728.mp4?t=1773394873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a bubble, move by shooting out small pieces of yourself, known as blips, to propel yourself in the opposite direction! This makes you smaller, allowing you to more easily fit through tight spaces, but be careful of getting too small and running out of bubble! Consume blips other racers leave behind to get bigger again! Smaller bubbles are easier to push around as well, so manage your size for the current situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/3474e6df808ba53c130a49ccf76d80cb.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/5a9d3ba785bbfe08ade67bc686349559.poster.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/5a9d3ba785bbfe08ade67bc686349559.webm?t=1773394873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/5a9d3ba785bbfe08ade67bc686349559.mp4?t=1773394873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubbles can charge their shot! Charging up slows you down and makes your shot stronger, which can be useful to change your direction, but uncharged shots can help you build speed. Mastering when to use each shot types is a key to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/6526ce2ebde75dad9144c025d8b556b8.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/853b2d6e97fb28ed365f3a1c6866cfad.avif?t=1773394873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras_big/853b2d6e97fb28ed365f3a1c6866cfad.webp?t=1773394873 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create online lobbies and invite up to 9 friends to race against! Simply vote on the track you want to play and it's off to the races! Push to go for first place, bump competitors to slow them down, the way you want to play is up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/63432ce2accd95f528b91f2c47cfe208.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/a7670b9db9d5bdabf8ea09cfa9b2b4c3.avif?t=1773394873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras_big/a7670b9db9d5bdabf8ea09cfa9b2b4c3.webp?t=1773394873 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on a wide variety of different tracks based on different bodies of water! Each track has their own layout and unique mechanics. Try them out and find out which track resonates with you the most, or try and master all of them!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/384b7cd4bfd5f1ce6518f0e21c326519.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/38a407859c9536e19433700c6a59b497.avif?t=1773394873\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras_big/38a407859c9536e19433700c6a59b497.avif?t=1773394873 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, you can play any track with no other racers and aim for the fastest time on Time Trials! This is a great mode to use to improve your skills. Compare your fastest time with other players! Reach certain time goals goals to earn medals, or see if you can get the world record time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/extras/7e66df5b7c4a661210e42d72d4e16a5e.avif?t=1773394873\" width=1560 height=317 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slipstream is still in development! We hope you look forward to hearing what more we have in store!</p>","developers":["Daisy Chain Games Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602870/be2364199ccb693d7e5759a055584b1dbf315d78/header.jpg?t=1773394873","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core Duo 2 or Better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 Capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> I copied Fallen game system requirements</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit 10.9<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9/OpenGL 4.1 Capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space<br></li